  "problem": "A programmer reviews his web page and notices that, on average, $7$ visitors view his page every minute. What is the probability that there will be $5$ visitors in the next minute? Round your answer to $3$ decimal places. You may assume that visitors connect to the site independently and at a constant average rate.",
